WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:37.840
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:37.920 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:53.640 --> 01:55.000
What do I like?

01:55.080 --> 01:55.920
That's right.

01:56.840 --> 01:57.920
What do you like?

01:58.000 --> 01:59.440
And what do you want?

01:59.520 --> 02:01.120
I'll bring whatever you want to you.

02:02.480 --> 02:04.240
Is he trying to make me happy?

02:06.560 --> 02:09.919
As long as it can make me happy,

02:10.000 --> 02:11.200
no matter what I say,

02:11.280 --> 02:13.160
you're always willing
to fulfill my wishes?

02:13.920 --> 02:14.880
Yes. Go ahead.

02:21.640 --> 02:24.480
I'll cook you something delicious today.

02:24.560 --> 02:27.040
And you'll go back to Haotian Tower
after the meal, all right?

02:30.960 --> 02:32.000
Except for this one.

02:32.080 --> 02:34.280
Give me back the Destiny Book.
I'll fix it for you.

02:34.360 --> 02:36.320
Then you'll go back
to Haotian Tower, all right?

02:36.920 --> 02:39.000
We'll talk about this once you recover.

02:40.880 --> 02:42.560
He has been so nice to me.

02:43.280 --> 02:45.080
He didn't mean to let me fix
the Destiny Book.

02:45.160 --> 02:47.880
It's just an excuse for him
to stay by my side.

02:47.960 --> 02:48.840
No.

02:48.920 --> 02:50.880
I can't let him
fall deeper in love with me.

02:53.400 --> 02:55.040
Except for you to go back
to Haotian Tower,

02:55.120 --> 02:57.120
I just want to pass
the immortal examination.

02:58.240 --> 02:59.560
The immortal examination?

03:01.600 --> 03:03.600
Shuiyuntian holds the immortal examination

03:03.680 --> 03:05.240
once every 100 years.

03:05.320 --> 03:06.640
As long as we pass the exam,

03:06.720 --> 03:09.600
we can become first-class members
of the Fairy Realm and be promoted.

03:09.680 --> 03:10.720
But…

03:10.800 --> 03:12.400
If we want to pass the exam,

03:12.480 --> 03:13.800
we must fight and subdue demons.

03:14.720 --> 03:16.400
My power is too weak.

03:17.160 --> 03:18.480
I might not be able to pass.

03:19.040 --> 03:20.520
You took the medicine last night

03:20.600 --> 03:22.120
for the exam, right?

03:23.240 --> 03:25.040
I thought I could cure my immortal roots.

03:25.120 --> 03:27.920
But I almost lost my life because of it.

03:30.160 --> 03:33.000
In order to serve tea to the immortals,

03:33.080 --> 03:34.920
you almost died.

03:35.000 --> 03:36.960
You're so stupid.

03:37.040 --> 03:38.400
You know nothing.

03:38.480 --> 03:40.120
The fairy who gets first place in the exam

03:40.200 --> 03:42.400
can get a position
at Lord Changheng's Fountain Palace.

03:42.480 --> 03:43.720
So what?

03:48.800 --> 03:49.680
Forget it.

03:49.760 --> 03:51.720
You don't even know
the battle with the Moon Tribe,

03:51.800 --> 03:54.160
let alone the prestige
of our Lord Changheng

03:54.240 --> 03:55.680
in the three realms.

03:56.440 --> 03:59.000
Lord Changheng
is the younger son of Lord Dong

03:59.080 --> 04:00.480
and Lord Yunzhong's younger brother.

04:00.560 --> 04:01.920
After the battle,

04:02.000 --> 04:03.560
Shuiyuntian was split apart.

04:04.040 --> 04:06.520
He regained all the lost territories

04:06.600 --> 04:08.480
within less than 6,000 years.

04:08.560 --> 04:12.000
He's just the best of a bad bunch.

04:13.120 --> 04:14.520
You can laugh at me every day,

04:14.600 --> 04:16.560
but you can't belittle
Lord Changheng like this.

04:22.880 --> 04:24.320
In my opinion,

04:24.400 --> 04:25.840
he was born too late.

04:25.920 --> 04:28.680
He was only hundreds of years old
during the battle.

04:28.760 --> 04:30.640
If he were born earlier,

04:30.720 --> 04:32.480
Dongfang Qingcang would be a nobody.

04:32.560 --> 04:33.920
He'd be no match for him.

04:34.000 --> 04:36.480
If he dares to provoke Lord Changheng,

04:36.560 --> 04:39.440
he will be beaten up
by our Lord Changheng.

04:42.320 --> 04:43.960
A young boy

04:44.440 --> 04:47.080
doesn't deserve to be compared
with Moon Supreme.

04:47.880 --> 04:49.560
You don't have to be jealous.

04:49.640 --> 04:50.880
Dongfang Qingcang is dead.

04:50.960 --> 04:52.400
There's no way to prove who will win.

04:53.840 --> 04:56.000
Anyway, Lord Changheng

04:56.080 --> 04:58.640
is not only the strongest
in the three realms,

04:58.720 --> 05:00.200
but also the dream lover

05:00.280 --> 05:02.360
of all the fairies in the Fairy Realm.

05:02.840 --> 05:04.440
He's also your dream lover?

05:07.320 --> 05:09.080
So he's the one you like?

05:12.440 --> 05:15.200
I actually know myself well.

05:15.960 --> 05:17.600
I'm just a lowly spirit.

05:18.160 --> 05:20.480
So I never dare to expect anything.

05:22.000 --> 05:23.720
As long as I can be closer to him

05:23.800 --> 05:25.240
and see him every day--

05:25.320 --> 05:26.200
Stop.

05:28.320 --> 05:30.440
I'm just asking what you like

05:30.520 --> 05:31.880
and what you want.

05:31.960 --> 05:34.400
Why do you keep talking nonsense?

05:34.480 --> 05:36.240
How is this nonsense?

05:36.320 --> 05:37.280
I mean…

05:41.400 --> 05:42.440
Forget it.

05:42.520 --> 05:44.080
You've been locked up for too long.

05:44.160 --> 05:45.160
It made you silly.

05:47.440 --> 05:49.800
Anyway, Daqiang, you have to know

05:49.880 --> 05:51.880
you can't waste your time on me.

05:51.960 --> 05:54.240
I can't respond to your kindness.

05:54.320 --> 05:55.960
I don't need your response.

05:59.080 --> 06:01.840
You're short-sighted.

06:01.920 --> 06:04.680
You don't know there are a lot of beauties
in the three realms.

06:04.760 --> 06:07.640
They are much prettier, cuter,
and more gentle than me.

06:11.400 --> 06:12.400
So what?

06:14.040 --> 06:16.640
I mean after seeing more beauties,

06:16.720 --> 06:18.600
you won't think I'm special.

06:18.680 --> 06:20.480
Then you wouldn't pester me like this.

06:20.560 --> 06:21.920
To me,

06:22.560 --> 06:24.360
no one in the three realms

06:24.440 --> 06:26.040
is as unique as you are.

06:26.800 --> 06:27.680
You…

06:30.920 --> 06:31.800
You…

06:32.960 --> 06:34.240
Anyway, I just want to tell you

06:34.320 --> 06:36.040
that the person I like is Lord Changheng,

06:36.120 --> 06:37.280
not you!

06:37.360 --> 06:39.640
I also hope that Lord Changheng
is the one by my side,

06:39.720 --> 06:41.120
not you.

06:41.200 --> 06:42.840
Do you understand?

06:53.080 --> 06:56.240
SOUL TRANSFORMATION GROUNDS, HAISHI

07:07.560 --> 07:10.360
My lord, I found out
the one who stole the Destiny Book

07:10.440 --> 07:12.440
was a nameless Fairy Orchid
of the Arbiter Hall.

07:13.280 --> 07:14.440
Arbiter Hall?

07:15.000 --> 07:16.480
Could it be

07:16.560 --> 07:20.000
the orchid plant
that inherited the Arbiter's power?

07:20.920 --> 07:23.080
No wonder she could steal
the Destiny Book.

07:23.960 --> 07:25.800
My lord, should we kill her?

07:25.880 --> 07:27.120
Kill her.

07:28.080 --> 07:28.920
Yes, my lord.

07:30.680 --> 07:31.640
Wait.

07:33.440 --> 07:34.920
Now Changheng is in Yujing.

07:35.920 --> 07:37.480
If there is a murder,

07:37.560 --> 07:39.120
he will investigate it thoroughly.

07:39.680 --> 07:41.520
It'll be bad if it involves Haishi.

07:41.600 --> 07:42.480
Then…

07:43.240 --> 07:45.000
Isn't the immortal examination coming?

07:45.720 --> 07:48.480
If something happens to her
during the exam…

08:15.760 --> 08:17.440
Lord…

08:17.520 --> 08:18.640
Lord Changheng.

08:19.600 --> 08:20.680
Stand up.

08:22.000 --> 08:23.920
Are you here to check the Destiny Book?

08:24.000 --> 08:24.960
I'll get it for you now.

08:25.040 --> 08:26.280
No need.

08:27.440 --> 08:29.000
Why are you here then?

08:29.080 --> 08:30.600
I'm here to be with you.

08:34.280 --> 08:37.039
Am I dreaming?

08:38.640 --> 08:40.039
From now on,

08:40.120 --> 08:41.640
I will stay by your side

08:41.720 --> 08:42.760
in this figure.

08:48.720 --> 08:50.760
It's you!

08:50.840 --> 08:51.960
Turn back now!

08:52.040 --> 08:53.320
Right now!

08:58.240 --> 08:59.440
Why are you angry?

09:02.360 --> 09:03.360
What do you think?

09:03.440 --> 09:05.120
How could you make fun of me like this?

09:05.680 --> 09:07.560
I'm not interested in teasing you.

09:07.640 --> 09:08.960
Didn't you say that

09:09.040 --> 09:10.480
you want Changheng to be with you,

09:10.560 --> 09:11.600
instead of me?

09:12.400 --> 09:14.200
What's wrong with you?

09:14.280 --> 09:15.760
You don't know anything

09:15.840 --> 09:17.360
about human nature and love.

09:17.440 --> 09:19.200
The strong don't need to understand those.

09:20.680 --> 09:21.840
You're hopeless.

09:25.080 --> 09:26.240
Then tell me.

09:26.320 --> 09:28.000
How can you be happy?

09:29.600 --> 09:31.400
The person I want to see
is Lord Changheng.

09:31.480 --> 09:33.800
The real Lord Changheng,
not the one you're pretending to be.

09:35.200 --> 09:36.560
It's simple.

09:36.640 --> 09:38.920
I'll tie him up to accompany you.

09:39.000 --> 09:40.320
Don't disturb him.

09:40.400 --> 09:41.720
How can you do that?

09:41.800 --> 09:44.280
Besides, if you go
and find Lord Changheng,

09:44.360 --> 09:46.120
he can kill you with just a little finger.

09:48.080 --> 09:50.120
Forget it. I have to prepare
for the examination.

09:50.200 --> 09:51.240
I need to be well-prepared.

09:51.320 --> 09:52.240
Don't take the exam.

09:52.880 --> 09:54.120
Why?

09:54.200 --> 09:55.960
Because you're too weak.
You'll be in danger.

09:58.080 --> 10:00.080
Anyway, I have to give it a try.

10:01.560 --> 10:04.400
Besides, don't you want me to be happy?

10:04.480 --> 10:07.040
If I can't pass the exam,
I can't go to the Fountain Palace.

10:07.120 --> 10:08.240
If I can't go there,

10:08.320 --> 10:09.920
I can't repay Lord Changheng's kindness.

10:10.000 --> 10:11.720
Then I won't be happy.

10:13.320 --> 10:14.760
Forget it. You won't understand.

10:14.840 --> 10:17.640
SHUYU FOREST, SHUIYUNTIAN

10:24.200 --> 10:27.600
FAIRY DANYIN

10:41.880 --> 10:44.520
SUPREME LIYUAN

10:46.200 --> 10:47.240
Father.

10:49.200 --> 10:50.560
If I hadn't come,

10:51.720 --> 10:53.680
you would be too obsessed.

10:54.880 --> 10:56.280
You're my daughter.

10:57.040 --> 10:58.560
Your status is noble.

10:59.040 --> 11:00.600
Why insist on taking the examination?

11:01.160 --> 11:02.480
Do you want to serve others?

11:13.240 --> 11:14.120
Father.

11:15.360 --> 11:16.720
I know what you think.

11:17.360 --> 11:19.400
You don't really want to stop me
from taking the exam.

11:20.320 --> 11:22.880
You just don't want me to enter
Lord Changheng's Fountain Palace.

11:25.240 --> 11:27.040
Changheng has got a fiancée.

11:27.600 --> 11:29.720
Goddess of Xilan has disappeared
for over 30,000 years.

11:29.800 --> 11:31.040
I'm afraid she has already died.

11:31.120 --> 11:33.120
Even if Lord Changheng
can't forget her at present

11:33.680 --> 11:35.840
and is still looking for her everywhere,
I don't mind.

11:36.720 --> 11:38.200
As long as I pass the examination

11:38.760 --> 11:39.800
and can be his attendant,

11:40.680 --> 11:41.920
he will fall in love with me

11:42.880 --> 11:44.160
as the days pass by.

11:45.880 --> 11:47.560
How clear do you want me to be

11:47.640 --> 11:49.200
to make you give up the love for him?

11:50.520 --> 11:52.160
The engagement of Changheng
and the Goddess

11:52.240 --> 11:54.160
is arranged by Lord Yunzhong.

11:56.120 --> 11:57.840
If Changheng falls in love with you,

11:59.200 --> 12:00.440
it won't be a happy ending.

12:01.880 --> 12:03.000
It's a misfortune instead.

12:17.000 --> 12:17.880
My lord.

12:18.440 --> 12:20.560
I can't believe
she wants to take the exam.

12:20.640 --> 12:22.040
With her talent and ability,

12:22.120 --> 12:23.560
it's hard to cultivate her.

12:25.240 --> 12:26.920
I've been a tyrant all my life.

12:27.000 --> 12:28.720
I didn't expect that serving a plant

12:28.800 --> 12:31.640
is even harder than conquering
the three realms and the whole world.

12:33.160 --> 12:34.280
My lord, please calm down.

12:39.720 --> 12:40.640
Forget it.

12:44.560 --> 12:46.600
I can get

12:46.680 --> 12:48.280
whatever I want.

12:49.960 --> 12:52.280
I want her to be

12:52.920 --> 12:54.720
the happiest woman in the world.

12:57.120 --> 12:58.520
You're almighty, my lord.

13:00.960 --> 13:02.520
ARBITER HALL

13:13.840 --> 13:16.320
ARBITER HALL

13:19.200 --> 13:20.160
Someone is coming.

13:20.240 --> 13:22.400
Bad news! Someone is coming! Hide!

13:22.480 --> 13:24.600
No matter what happens, don't come out.

13:25.440 --> 13:26.760
Hurry up!

13:26.840 --> 13:27.920
Hurry!

13:33.680 --> 13:35.000
Fairy Danyin.

13:35.080 --> 13:35.920
What brings you here?

13:36.000 --> 13:37.080
Give me my Destiny Book.

13:37.160 --> 13:39.200
I want to see
if I can get into the Fountain Palace.

13:39.280 --> 13:40.240
Fairy Danyin,

13:40.320 --> 13:42.600
you need the order
from a senior immortal first.

13:42.680 --> 13:43.960
Just bring it to me.

13:44.040 --> 13:44.960
Cut the crap.

13:45.520 --> 13:47.000
This is the rule of the Arbiter Hall.

13:47.080 --> 13:48.080
I'm just a little fairy.

13:48.160 --> 13:49.720
I have no right to do that.

13:56.200 --> 13:57.600
I'll beat you up if you disobey me.

13:58.880 --> 13:59.880
Fairy Danyin.

14:09.720 --> 14:10.600
This…

14:10.680 --> 14:12.560
Fairy Danyin, you…

14:12.640 --> 14:15.840
How could you destroy
the Destiny Book just like that?

14:16.840 --> 14:18.960
You can't read the Destiny Book
as you wish,

14:19.040 --> 14:20.320
nor break it.

14:21.000 --> 14:22.720
I have to fix it again.

14:59.120 --> 15:00.440
Lord Changheng.

15:02.120 --> 15:03.160
His wedding ceremony?

15:09.280 --> 15:11.040
Why is he wearing mortal clothes?

15:29.480 --> 15:32.680
And the bride is not me?

15:40.640 --> 15:41.600
Who is she?

16:02.040 --> 16:03.360
Luckily, it's not broken.

16:10.520 --> 16:11.720
What is

16:13.000 --> 16:14.040
this tree hole?

16:16.000 --> 16:17.800
This is not a tree hole.

16:17.880 --> 16:19.160
It's the Tianji Mirror.

16:19.240 --> 16:21.080
It's a treasure
that can predict the future.

16:21.160 --> 16:23.640
My master's master's master made it.

16:24.200 --> 16:25.680
Is what you see in it

16:28.040 --> 16:29.120
all true?

16:29.200 --> 16:30.600
Of course.

16:31.320 --> 16:32.440
Nonsense!

16:33.560 --> 16:34.520
You're lying to me.

16:35.360 --> 16:37.600
How would I dare lie to you?

16:41.080 --> 16:42.320
I'll ask you for the last time.

16:43.400 --> 16:44.720
Is the thing inside the mirror

16:45.880 --> 16:46.920
true or not?

16:47.000 --> 16:49.160
Yes, it's true.

16:49.920 --> 16:52.240
Those Destiny Books can change karma.

16:52.320 --> 16:54.040
But what's inside the Tianji Mirror

16:54.120 --> 16:55.520
is destined to happen

16:55.600 --> 16:57.400
and it can't be changed.

17:10.319 --> 17:12.000
That hurts.

17:26.160 --> 17:27.400
Are you afraid of her?

17:28.800 --> 17:30.160
Just a little.

17:30.240 --> 17:33.240
Fairy Danyin could be
unreasonable sometimes.

17:34.120 --> 17:35.880
Since she is a threat to you,

17:38.240 --> 17:40.160
I'll kill her for you.

17:42.040 --> 17:43.240
Are you crazy?

17:43.320 --> 17:44.960
Why are you always fighting and killing?

17:45.040 --> 17:46.680
Can you stop causing me trouble?

17:50.280 --> 17:51.160
Forget it.

17:51.880 --> 17:53.400
As long as you're happy,

17:53.480 --> 17:54.720
I can do whatever you want.

17:55.640 --> 17:57.440
Just stay here.

17:57.520 --> 18:00.120
You can't go anywhere
or do anything elsewhere.

18:00.200 --> 18:01.920
I'm going to prepare for the exam.

18:07.320 --> 18:11.800
YUJING, SHUIYUNTIAN

18:13.120 --> 18:14.560
How's your preparations for the exam?

18:18.880 --> 18:20.080
Luckily, I'm not late.

18:20.920 --> 18:22.480
You really came to take the exam?

18:23.240 --> 18:24.120
It's all right.

18:24.200 --> 18:25.840
She will be in the last place.

18:25.920 --> 18:27.080
Right.

18:28.680 --> 18:31.160
Look. It's Fairy Danyin.

18:31.240 --> 18:32.560
Look at her dignity.

18:32.640 --> 18:34.920
She's indeed the chosen one
by Lord Changheng.

18:35.000 --> 18:36.120
What are you talking about?

18:36.680 --> 18:38.360
The exam hasn't started yet.

18:38.440 --> 18:40.120
It's uncertain who will be chosen.

18:40.600 --> 18:43.080
Yulin, haven't you heard?

18:43.160 --> 18:45.600
Lord Changheng was in seclusion
for seven days

18:45.680 --> 18:48.400
to make the Immortal Pill
for Fairy Danyin.

18:48.480 --> 18:49.640
The Immortal Pill?

18:50.720 --> 18:52.600
It's an efficient tool for cultivation.

18:53.160 --> 18:54.880
If Lord Changheng gave it to Fairy Danyin,

18:54.960 --> 18:57.800
it would be obvious
that he wants her to win.

18:57.880 --> 19:00.720
We must have wasted our time.

19:00.800 --> 19:02.160
Our efforts will be all in vain.

19:03.400 --> 19:05.480
Then let's think about
how to please Danyin.

19:05.560 --> 19:07.920
We may get a position
as substitutes some day later.

19:08.000 --> 19:10.000
Don't forget how hard we cultivated.

19:11.560 --> 19:12.760
There will be a chance for us.

19:21.680 --> 19:23.480
LADY SANSHENG

19:23.560 --> 19:24.480
Silence!

19:37.320 --> 19:39.400
- It's Lord Changheng.
- Lord Changheng.

19:39.480 --> 19:41.000
It's Lord Changheng.

20:22.600 --> 20:23.520
Where is Ronghao?

20:25.200 --> 20:26.440
I haven't seen him yet.

20:27.480 --> 20:29.040
He said he wanted to watch.

20:29.120 --> 20:30.600
I even arranged a seat for him.

20:30.680 --> 20:31.800
But where is he now?

20:39.560 --> 20:41.720
You're indeed our famous God of War.

20:41.800 --> 20:43.720
There are so many fairies gathered here

20:43.800 --> 20:44.760
just to see you.

20:46.880 --> 20:49.080
But is the love of our God of War

20:49.160 --> 20:50.280
among them?

20:58.040 --> 20:59.480
It's so beautiful.

21:00.120 --> 21:02.280
It would be great
if I could pick one of them

21:02.360 --> 21:03.680
as a lantern at night.

21:04.320 --> 21:05.240
It's not difficult.

21:06.080 --> 21:07.520
How is it not difficult?

21:07.600 --> 21:09.400
Stars are far away from here.

21:09.480 --> 21:11.280
It's extremely hard to get them.

21:12.760 --> 21:14.640
There is a spirit stone
in the Northernmost Ocean

21:14.720 --> 21:16.320
called the Magical Firefly Stone.

21:16.880 --> 21:18.520
There are fireflies in the stone.

21:18.600 --> 21:20.880
They shine at night.

21:22.440 --> 21:23.320
They'll shine

21:24.000 --> 21:25.120
like the stars in the sky

21:27.720 --> 21:28.680
But…

21:29.320 --> 21:30.840
The Northernmost Ocean is far from here

21:30.920 --> 21:32.000
and it's so cold there.

21:32.480 --> 21:33.640
I can't go there to get them.

21:34.560 --> 21:35.520
If you want,

21:36.720 --> 21:38.040
I can give you the stars.

21:39.280 --> 21:40.400
Really?

21:43.320 --> 21:44.320
Really?

21:48.000 --> 21:49.200
Lord Changheng.

21:58.240 --> 22:00.320
Lord Changheng, your spirit jade.

22:01.840 --> 22:03.120
Thirty thousand years ago,

22:03.200 --> 22:05.240
if the former God of War, Lady Chidi,
didn't seal

22:05.320 --> 22:07.360
the soldiers of the Moon Tribe
with her death,

22:07.440 --> 22:09.920
the fairies would have been destroyed
by the Moon Tribe long ago.

22:10.000 --> 22:12.840
After the battle,
the fairies started to be alert to danger.

22:12.920 --> 22:15.240
- I was right, wasn't I?
- The gods were humiliated.

22:15.320 --> 22:16.320
In this exam,

22:16.400 --> 22:19.000
we invited the God of War,
Lord Changheng as the judge.

22:19.080 --> 22:20.200
And Lord Yunzhong

22:20.280 --> 22:22.680
- as the supervisor.
- Keep talking nonsense, I'll send you out.

22:23.240 --> 22:26.160
All the fairies need to do your best

22:26.240 --> 22:27.600
and wait for the evaluation.

22:28.920 --> 22:30.560
The candidates

22:30.640 --> 22:31.960
must use the Demon Pills

22:32.040 --> 22:33.760
to subdue the monsters in Shuyu Forest.

22:33.840 --> 22:36.240
If you succeed before sunset,

22:36.800 --> 22:37.960
you'll pass the exam.

22:41.560 --> 22:42.840
Thank you, my lord.

22:59.280 --> 23:00.640
Thank you, my lord.

23:28.160 --> 23:29.040
Be careful.

23:52.200 --> 23:54.560
There are 48 candidates this time.

23:54.640 --> 23:57.440
But there are only nine monsters
in Shuyu Forest.

23:58.720 --> 24:00.240
No matter what it takes,

24:00.320 --> 24:02.880
the ones who subdue the monsters
will pass.

24:02.960 --> 24:06.720
Which fairy would like to enter
the Shuyu Forest first?

24:08.440 --> 24:09.560
Go ahead.

24:33.720 --> 24:35.440
- I--
- All right, Fairy Orchid.

24:35.520 --> 24:36.440
You are the first one.

24:37.320 --> 24:41.240
I don't know who pushed me just now.

24:42.640 --> 24:44.960
My lord, are you really going to help her?

24:46.520 --> 24:47.440
What?

24:48.400 --> 24:49.240
Nothing.

24:49.880 --> 24:51.040
I just think

24:51.120 --> 24:52.640
you are the master of the three realms.

24:53.200 --> 24:55.520
How can you do these tricks
for a plain fairy

24:55.600 --> 24:56.960
and even cheat for her?

24:57.040 --> 24:58.560
I really can't stand it.

24:59.120 --> 25:00.960
Do I have other choices?

25:02.600 --> 25:03.680
My lord, I don't understand

25:03.760 --> 25:06.120
why you have to do all of these for her.

26:18.800 --> 26:20.440
My lords, you can observe them

26:20.520 --> 26:22.160
through the Kuitian Mirror.

27:21.920 --> 27:23.680
This Orchid is a coward.

27:24.240 --> 27:26.080
She's easily frightened.

27:26.160 --> 27:28.440
But why isn't she afraid of you?

27:33.000 --> 27:33.840
I'm sorry.

27:35.200 --> 27:37.720
My lord, there are nine monsters
in the forest.

27:38.240 --> 27:40.400
I will catch all of them
for her immediately.

27:40.480 --> 27:41.520
No need.

27:42.160 --> 27:43.680
This will make people suspicious.

27:44.440 --> 27:46.040
Go and lure the weakest one here.

27:46.120 --> 27:47.080
Yes.

28:52.960 --> 28:54.120
I'll move it again.

29:08.440 --> 29:09.840
Is this

29:10.880 --> 29:11.760
a Yingzhao?

29:30.640 --> 29:31.480
Don't run!

29:35.920 --> 29:38.480
This Yingzhao seems to feel you.

29:38.560 --> 29:40.800
If we keep following Orchid,

29:42.560 --> 29:45.480
I'm afraid no monster would dare
to approach her.

29:45.560 --> 29:46.720
Let's keep a distance.

29:47.320 --> 29:48.280
Yes, my lord.

30:03.320 --> 30:04.440
Yingzhao.

30:05.160 --> 30:09.280
You look fatter than in the book.

30:11.160 --> 30:12.480
I brought you

30:12.560 --> 30:14.640
your favorite Hound's Tongue.

30:19.480 --> 30:20.920
Have more.

30:23.280 --> 30:25.240
My power is weak.
I can only use my wisdom.

30:25.320 --> 30:28.160
While you are eating the Hound's Tongue
and have your guard down…

30:29.960 --> 30:31.440
Sorry, Yingzhao.

30:32.320 --> 30:33.720
This Orchid

30:34.280 --> 30:35.200
is weak in power,

30:35.280 --> 30:36.480
but she's quite smart.

30:36.560 --> 30:38.160
Not only that.

30:38.240 --> 30:40.280
The beasts can identify
pure and kind people.

30:40.840 --> 30:42.440
That's why Yingzhao trusts her so much.

31:03.720 --> 31:04.880
You…

31:04.960 --> 31:05.840
What are you doing?

31:06.440 --> 31:07.440
I want this one.

31:10.600 --> 31:12.520
But I found it first.

31:13.160 --> 31:14.000
You found it?

31:14.480 --> 31:17.040
Did the judge say the beast would belong
to whoever finds it first?

31:18.560 --> 31:19.480
No.

31:19.560 --> 31:20.520
Step aside.

31:21.720 --> 31:22.880
No. I won't.

31:24.400 --> 31:26.160
What? You won't?

31:26.240 --> 31:27.440
It's not up to you.

31:28.560 --> 31:29.640
There's a private fight.

31:30.480 --> 31:32.760
As long as they can capture the monster,

31:32.840 --> 31:34.160
there are no limited ways.

31:34.240 --> 31:36.080
So private fights
are not against the rules.

31:43.840 --> 31:44.840
Fairy Danyin.

31:45.800 --> 31:47.440
You're so powerful.

31:47.520 --> 31:48.840
Why do you still want mine?

31:48.920 --> 31:50.000
I can give up this one,

31:50.080 --> 31:52.480
but you can't catch a single one.

31:52.560 --> 31:53.640
Why?

31:54.720 --> 31:55.920
I remember

31:56.000 --> 31:58.520
that I didn't offend you before.

31:58.600 --> 31:59.560
There's no reason.

31:59.640 --> 32:00.680
You should quit

32:00.760 --> 32:02.440
and never take the exam again.

32:04.320 --> 32:05.560
I won't quit.

32:05.640 --> 32:06.480
Say it again.

32:06.560 --> 32:07.640
I won't quit!

32:09.040 --> 32:09.920
Don't forget

32:10.000 --> 32:12.240
we are allowed to have private fights
in the exam.

32:12.320 --> 32:13.560
It's inevitable

32:13.640 --> 32:15.600
if I accidentally ruin
your 1,000-year cultivation

32:15.680 --> 32:18.160
and beat you back into a stupid plant

32:19.960 --> 32:21.200
that hasn't been enlightened.

32:21.280 --> 32:22.120
Get lost!

32:22.200 --> 32:24.680
- Get out of here!
- Get out of the way, Orchid!

32:24.760 --> 32:26.320
- Give us that beast!
- You want to get beaten?

32:26.400 --> 32:28.360
- Get out of here!
- Go!

32:28.440 --> 32:29.320
I won't quit!

32:31.880 --> 32:32.840
Normally,

32:33.560 --> 32:35.080
I can let you bully me.

32:36.080 --> 32:37.320
But today,

32:37.880 --> 32:39.680
I will never run away.

32:41.200 --> 32:42.520
Even if I have to risk my life,

32:43.120 --> 32:44.800
I must pass the exam.

32:44.880 --> 32:47.280
I must go to the Fountain Palace
to repay Lord Changheng!

32:47.360 --> 32:49.520
How dare you mention him?

32:58.200 --> 32:59.760
What are you waiting for?

33:38.440 --> 33:39.480
Orchid Spirit.

33:40.640 --> 33:41.720
Wait and see.

33:44.480 --> 33:45.680
Let's go.

33:49.880 --> 33:51.240
I can't believe I'm so strong.

33:52.000 --> 33:53.040
Could it be…

33:53.800 --> 33:55.200
that I am enlightened?

33:58.680 --> 34:01.160
Yingzhao, thank you for helping me.

34:23.520 --> 34:24.400
Me?

34:30.719 --> 34:31.719
Great.

34:31.800 --> 34:34.360
If I subdue you, I'll have the chance
to go to the Fountain Palace

34:34.440 --> 34:35.840
to serve Lord Changheng.

34:58.360 --> 34:59.560
There's an evil spirit.

35:01.480 --> 35:03.320
Keep an eye on her. I'll be right back.

35:03.880 --> 35:04.800
Yes.

35:55.520 --> 35:56.520
Why is this happening?

36:10.200 --> 36:12.200
Yingzhao, what's wrong with you?

36:13.880 --> 36:15.600
Yingzhao, what's wrong?

36:38.520 --> 36:40.600
Help!

36:51.600 --> 36:52.920
Help!

36:58.400 --> 36:59.680
Why is this happening?

37:15.640 --> 37:17.000
Help!

38:04.880 --> 38:05.960
Fairy Danyin!

38:15.720 --> 38:16.920
Leave now!

38:23.000 --> 38:24.320
Fairy Danyin.

38:24.400 --> 38:25.360
Are you all right?

38:26.040 --> 38:26.920
You…

38:54.560 --> 38:56.080
What are you waiting for?

38:56.160 --> 38:57.480
Come and help!

39:04.560 --> 39:06.000
Fairy Yulin!

39:06.080 --> 39:08.480
Fairy Danyin and Orchid
are attacked by a beast.

39:08.560 --> 39:09.720
Let's go and save them.

39:09.800 --> 39:11.440
Stop! Don't go.

39:12.520 --> 39:14.520
This is the perfect timing.

39:14.600 --> 39:16.160
They are trapped by the beast.

39:16.240 --> 39:18.640
We have to seize this chance
and win the exam.

39:20.960 --> 39:22.400
God is on my side.

39:46.080 --> 39:47.080
There's a tree hole.

39:47.160 --> 39:48.320
Everyone, go inside and hide.

39:51.720 --> 39:52.680
Hurry!

39:54.040 --> 39:55.160
Hurry!

40:07.800 --> 40:09.120
All of you,

40:09.200 --> 40:10.720
listen to me.

40:11.320 --> 40:12.600
Are your Demon Pills still here?

40:12.680 --> 40:14.160
- Yes.
- Yes.

40:15.160 --> 40:17.600
Yingzhao is too strong now.

40:17.680 --> 40:20.240
It can't be subdued with only one pill.

40:20.320 --> 40:22.720
If we gather all the Demon Pills together,

40:22.800 --> 40:24.600
maybe we can subdue it.

40:24.680 --> 40:25.800
Shut up.

40:25.880 --> 40:27.240
Don't mention such a bad idea!

40:35.440 --> 40:36.760
Listen to me.

40:36.840 --> 40:38.240
We will die if we keep hiding here.

40:38.320 --> 40:40.280
How about I go out and distract it?

40:40.360 --> 40:41.960
You go and find Aunt Sansheng

40:42.040 --> 40:42.960
and ask her to save us.

40:46.840 --> 40:47.880
Here you are.

40:49.880 --> 40:51.080
- Hurry.
- Here, take mine.

40:51.560 --> 40:52.520
It's mine.

41:04.040 --> 41:04.920
Be careful.

41:05.720 --> 41:06.600
All right.

41:53.080 --> 41:53.920
Yingzhao.

41:54.000 --> 41:56.640
Catch me if you dare!

42:06.640 --> 42:07.800
Father!

42:07.880 --> 42:08.840
Father!

42:08.920 --> 42:10.480
Aunt Sansheng, hurry and save Orchid.

42:10.560 --> 42:11.720
She's in danger!

42:21.440 --> 42:23.160
Danyin!

42:24.920 --> 42:26.400
Danyin, are you all right?

42:26.480 --> 42:28.640
- I'm fine.
- Stay here. Don't go anywhere.

42:28.720 --> 42:29.680
Father!

42:33.600 --> 42:34.440
Orchid!

42:39.000 --> 42:39.920
Orchid!

42:44.080 --> 42:45.920
- Let's split up.
- All right.

42:46.440 --> 42:47.320
Orchid!

42:50.440 --> 42:51.320
Orchid!

43:08.480 --> 43:10.360
Help!
